text = PackedStringArray("Now, all of our contestants did a wonderful job dispatching their personal demons!", "That being said, some did do a [b][i]less[/i][/b] wonderful job than others!", "Here are the losers~!", "In third place, we have [NAME] with a measely [POINTS] points!~", "In second place, we have [NAME] with a mediocre [POINTS] points~!", "And, finally, our winner . . . ", "[NAME] with a slightly less disappointing [POINTS] points!~", "Let\'s hear it for this year\'s,\\n[b][i]Priestess of Victory[/i][/b], [NAME]~!", "For her prize, she gets to keep her wish . . .", "And, she scores a brand deal with us~!", "That\'s right ladies and gents she gets to keep fighting the baddies~", "~so long as she agrees to give 99% of her merchandising profits to our organization!", "Everyone wins!\\n[color=#8c8c8c]Especially us![/color]")

